Package: motanka-stack-shell
Architecture: amd64
Depends: motanka-qt6,
         ${shlibs:Depends},
         ${misc:Depends},
Description: Hyprland stack for Motanka - desktop shell
 Motanka is an Omarchy-compatible Hyprland layer for Ubuntu. Its Stack is
 the Hyprland compositor with its companion programs and libraries at the
 versions upstream Omarchy expects, installed under /opt/motanka.
 .
 This package holds Quickshell, the QML desktop shell upstream Omarchy uses
 for its bar and menus, and the cpptrace library its crash handler needs.
 It runs on the Qt 6.12 in motanka-qt6 on both Ubuntu 24.04 and 26.04 and
 never loads Ubuntu's own Qt.
